{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43248","headline":"瑜不掩瑕 · 柴宿","name":"瑜不掩瑕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗玉微瑕在，分明异璞瑜。\n坚贞宁可杂，美恶自能殊。\n待价知弥久，称忠定不诬。\n光辉今见黜，毫发外呈符。\n岂假良工指，堪爲达士模。\n他山傥磨琢，慕爱是洪鑪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柴宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}